on and adaptability issues. So we could propose D as new leading candidate.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: we agree that reliability and decision quality are critical, but note that C's communication issues may outweigh his reliability. Provide evidence: C difficulty communicating, egocentric, not willing to further education. D's strengths: concentrates, solves problems, takes responsibility, responds adequately to unexpected events. Concern: moody, loner (crew cooperation). Argue that D's strengths align with multiple criteria: technical competence (problem solving), attention (concentration), responsibility, stress resilience (responds to unexpected events). While his moody and loner traits could affect crew cooperation, they may be mitigated with training.\n\nThus we vote for D.\n\nWe must include explicit candidate facts as evidence. Provide reasoning.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate D\"."}
